  "description": "🍂 Celebrate the warmest moments of fall with this Cozy Autumn Activities Watercolor Clipart collection featuring 19 seasonal illustrations inspired by autumn hobbies, cozy home moments, fall treats, reading, baking, crafting, markets, and relaxing seasonal routines.\nFrom pumpkin spice drinks, apple baskets, caramel apples, cookies, fresh bread, candles, books, knitting, puzzles, headphones, and cozy reading corners to an autumn market stand, bookstore, fireplace, and charming fall houses, this collection is perfect for creating warm seasonal designs that capture the feeling of a slow and cozy autumn day.\n☕ Perfect for:\n– Digital & printable stickers\n– Digital & printable planners\n– Digital & printable journals\n– Autumn scrapbook pages\n– Fall bucket lists\n– Cozy lifestyle printables\n– Reading journal decorations\n– Baking and recipe projects\n– Autumn activity trackers\n– Fall stationery\n– Greeting cards\n– Seasonal invitations\n– Mugs and tumblers\n– T-shirts and sweatshirts\n– Tote bags\n– Sublimation projects\n– Social media graphics\n– Cozy home decor projects\n– Digital crafting\n– Print on Demand\n✨ What’s included:\n– 19 PNG files with transparent backgrounds\n– 19 SVG files\n– 3000 x 3000 px\n🍁 Included illustrations:\nAutumn cookies, open book wrapped in plaid blanket, apple basket, baked apple crisp, knitting project with yarn, pumpkin spice drink, autumn pumpkin mug, fall puzzle, autumn market stand, caramel apples, fall scented candle, cozy reading chair by rainy window, autumn bookshop, fall headphones, takeaway coffee with cozy sleeve, fresh bread on plaid cloth, pumpkin spice latte, autumn fireplace, cozy fall house\n🕯️ This cozy autumn clipart bundle is perfect for fall planners, seasonal journals, autumn bucket lists, reading projects, baking printables, scrapbook pages, stickers, apparel, mugs, tote bags, sublimation designs, and cozy lifestyle merchandise. Use the individual illustrations to create warm autumn scenes inspired by reading, baking, crafting, coffee dates, farmers markets, rainy afternoons, and relaxing evenings at home.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🍂 Celebrate the warmest moments of fall with this Cozy Autumn Activities Watercolor Clipart collection featuring 19 seasonal illustrations inspired by autumn hobbies, cozy home moments, fall treats, reading, baking, crafting, markets, and relaxing seasonal routines.<br>\nFrom pumpkin spice drinks, apple baskets, caramel apples, cookies, fresh bread, candles, books, knitting, puzzles, headphones, and cozy reading corners to an autumn market stand, bookstore, fireplace, and charming fall houses, this collection is perfect for creating warm seasonal designs that capture the feeling of a slow and cozy autumn day.</p>\n<p>☕ Perfect for:<br>\n– Digital &amp; printable stickers<br>\n– Digital &amp; printable planners<br>\n– Digital &amp; printable journals<br>\n– Autumn scrapbook pages<br>\n– Fall bucket lists<br>\n– Cozy lifestyle printables<br>\n– Reading journal decorations<br>\n– Baking and recipe projects<br>\n– Autumn activity trackers<br>\n– Fall stationery<br>\n– Greeting cards<br>\n– Seasonal invitations<br>\n– Mugs and tumblers<br>\n– T-shirts and sweatshirts<br>\n– Tote bags<br>\n– Sublimation projects<br>\n– Social media graphics<br>\n– Cozy home decor projects<br>\n– Digital crafting<br>\n– Print on Demand</p>\n<p>✨ What’s included:<br>\n– 19 PNG files with transparent backgrounds<br>\n– 19 SVG files<br>\n– 3000 x 3000 px</p>\n<p>🍁 Included illustrations:<br>\nAutumn cookies, open book wrapped in plaid blanket, apple basket, baked apple crisp, knitting project with yarn, pumpkin spice drink, autumn pumpkin mug, fall puzzle, autumn market stand, caramel apples, fall scented candle, cozy reading chair by rainy window, autumn bookshop, fall headphones, takeaway coffee with cozy sleeve, fresh bread on plaid cloth, pumpkin spice latte, autumn fireplace, cozy fall house</p>\n<p>🕯️ This cozy autumn clipart bundle is perfect for fall planners, seasonal journals, autumn bucket lists, reading projects, baking printables, scrapbook pages, stickers, apparel, mugs, tote bags, sublimation designs, and cozy lifestyle merchandise. Use the individual illustrations to create warm autumn scenes inspired by reading, baking, crafting, coffee dates, farmers markets, rainy afternoons, and relaxing evenings at home.</p>",
